    "answer": {
        "text": "§\nOctreotide can be used to inhibit tumors secreting what 6 hormones?\n\n(1) Growth hormone\n(2) VIP\n\n(3) Serotonin\n\n(4) Insulin\n\n(5) Glucagon\n\n(6) Gastrin\n\n[Image: 76f6092bb94de685885912d04ccdbdffddab82a53e1e8fa4a7734a054e0c6bd8]\n\n[Image: 9a74af955b51573749889f756a35f9d1e585eac6bdcdc03efee7d99c43714cad]\n\n[Image: 4a676b7e65d104ea1f40d09fb7fcd41cf66b12dd51f5b026bc8ac0731ea4c998]\n\n[Image: 886b12882f948446b5b7a7e7e61048280940d2f6aaf1c8b9f4913e6226fff0f6]\n\n4.2 - Growth hormone, mecasermin, octreotide, pegvisomant\n[Image: 94015af0f388bd853064c3ae7e9bd4f190e7244a0dfb7c9f09c727f096baae66]\n\n[Image: 035165bf66d5f8e95d7b9bfa64cfde4c09dae559bf88778a8662a81de9ce0298]\n\n[Image: c8b9d5f2a975ba4a48bd1e627159c37063448236e6b20f88df50fa079c534c4d]\n\n[Image: 9e642979ff36736fccdd76994c6335e700a490848c79ab59b01f8e8362e6cad3]",
